      "side": 1,
      "message": "This looks problematic, and the main issue is it\u0027s being called from the animators tick (`onSync`) as opposed to the revalidation phase (`onRevalidate`):\n\n  - the animator evaluation order is not well defined, so this may run before other animations mutate the layer props -\u003e `hasChildrenInval` could return a false negative at this stage and we\u0027d be ignoring animated layer content\n  \n  - passing an identity CTM ignores layer transforms\n  \n\nI think the solution is to move the shader instantiation from `SkSkShaderAdapter::onSync` to `SkSLShaderNode::onRevalidate`, where you have access to IC/CTM and it is also guaranteed to run after all the animator updates.  That means we\u0027ll likely need to have all the uniforms pushed to `SkSLShaderNode` also, as `SG_ATTRIBUTE`s.  That\u0027s a significant refactor though, we can tackle in a follow-up.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 59,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 61,
        "endChar": 54
      },
